@startuml
title Multilingual tender RAG — local prototype
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
actor "Reader" as Reader
folder "Tender PDFs + metadata" as Docs
[PDF extraction / OCR fallback] as Extract
[Chunking + Jina v3 embeddings] as Embed
database "Local Qdrant" as Qdrant
[Streamlit interface] as UI
[Language / metadata routing] as Router
[Retrieval + optional reranking] as Search
[Ollama local model] as LLM
[Answer with retrieved sources] as Answer
Docs --> Extract
Extract --> Embed
Embed --> Qdrant
Reader --> UI : English / German question
UI --> Router
Router --> Search
Search --> Qdrant : find relevant passages
Qdrant --> Search : candidates
Search --> LLM : selected context
LLM --> Answer
Answer --> UI
note bottom of Answer
Answer quality depends on retrieval.
No claim of secure public hosting.
end note
@enduml
